        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Rih ’dow bam the, “Rihpwan,",
            "rihpwan,” twna kauc the,",
            "Kabamv ’thuic khou trampet khwan hei chu the,",
            "Rihpy hei {:1 rih ngamlou khang ruan pat pw the,",
            "How nuangc ni the ’chumhmei {:1 rih ngammei.",
            "",
            "Rih ’dow bam the, Khristian ricmei,",
            "Ding rianna zaw lev zaw adyangna;",
            "Rihpwan kachan the, kailiangh alang the;",
            "’Chumhmei lev ’khuaimei ’dow bam the;",
            "Rih’dow bam the tiki ping riu,",
            "Bauc o, Kangamv 1<: sin ’tip la tho;",
            "Kaipou Ravguangc hei ’niu biak liangc ethei",
            "’Niu rihngam lu suan puni de.",
            "",
            "2 Rih ’dow bam the, he rihmei thiu, baucna thau tho,",
            "Poubauhmei {:1 zaylouna rih ngam ni;",
            "Ravguangc tiimei ricpwan hei piuna kaamc thau tho,",
            "Rih luai mak saanv Kangamv khou akhangv o.",
            "",
            "3 Poubauhmei {:1 rih ngam khang chaeng zaylou bam the,",
            "Kalatryan hei neihpat nganv lik tangc the;",
            "Poubauhmei zanc kabam ’thuic khou chakhwang sw diu,",
            "Chuzaenghmei ganv, lauthwan kiu ’naa guang the."
          ]
        }
      },
